


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_41d01c1b:


    "教堂里，文弹奏着风琴。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_84fa1786:


    "被吩咐在圣歌会上担任伴奏的文，得到了放学后来这里练习的特别许可。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_5ae48b52:



    voice "FUM_0901"
    fumi "「那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_0af56644:


    "文弹奏的手停了下来。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_436a87eb:



    voice "HIN_1077"
    hina "「啊，我打搅到你了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_6b9db729:


    "站在讲台前拿着玩具相机的人自然是阳菜了。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_db95a42b:


    "刚才开始她就一直在风琴边上忙乎着，一会儿蹲下拍拍照，一会儿站起来按按快门。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_a3adebaa:



    voice "FUM_0902"
    fumi "「倒不是打搅到我了……而是想问，拍我很开心吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_d4ac342a:



    voice "HIN_1078"
    hina "「当然！毕竟我现在最想拍的就是你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_15672c87:



    voice "FUM_0903"
    fumi "「这样啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_c9469032:



    voice "HIN_1079"
    hina "「我说过的吧，我只拍我喜欢的事物」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_7db3ee85:



    voice "FUM_0904"
    fumi "「谢谢……我应该这么说吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_c6957351:


    "总之先道个谢。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_f61e8ddf:



    voice "HIN_1080"
    hina "「最近我说过，想再拍到一次天使的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_5fb162d1:


    "文想起来，点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_90ac775d:



    voice "HIN_1081"
    hina "「现在我实现那个愿望啦。因为我现在正拍着小文呢♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_eab5ce0f:



    voice "FUM_0905"
    fumi "「哇哇……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_009b1011:


    "阳菜有时会不自觉地说些很令人害羞的话。让人不知该怎么反应。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_2b1eb037:



    voice "HIN_1082"
    hina "「我想成为世界上把小文拍得最漂亮的摄影师。不如说我有自信能拍好！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_5fdcb11c:



    voice "FUM_0906"
    fumi "「嗯……那就拜托你了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_5cb77205:



    voice "HIN_1083"
    hina "「那赶紧让我接着拍啦。啊，小文你别在意我，继续弹吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_4412d68b:



    voice "FUM_0907"
    fumi "「我知道了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_11b96675:



    voice "HIN_1084"
    hina "「小文，表情太僵硬了。自然点就好」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_d31cf796:



    voice "FUM_0908"
    fumi "「嗯、好」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_1237fa2d:


    "越是这么说，越让文变得不自在起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_db33c72a:



    voice "HIN_1085"
    hina "「来来，放松，放松～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_fa68c2cf:



    voice "FUM_0909"
    fumi "「呜呜呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_34b714a4:


    "看来今天很难再拍到表现自然的照片了。"




translate simplified_chinese a04_cou1_04_649cfa17:


    "被吩咐在圣歌会上担任伴奏的文，得到了放学后来这里练习的特别许可。"
